  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I don't think anyone likes having to set the forced camera near distance setting to their preferred settings every time they launch the game.\n\nInstead of having it reset every time in order to avoid rare visual oddities in a few worlds why not make it persist but also allow worlds to limit it with Udon or maybe just a toggle? Just like they currently have the ability to do so for avatar scaling.",
